  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment - FAO Food Security, Rom - Secondment - FAO Food System Hub, MM</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekundering - FAO Food System Hub, Rom</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r kopplad till FAOs uppdrag om &#xf6;kad mats&#xe4;kerhet och hur l&#xe4;nderna f&#xf6;ljer upp SDG 2 dvs Ingen hunger och hur l&#xe4;nderna arbetar f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka matproduktionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This secondment is linked to FAOs assignment Food Security, and to follow-up how the countries are doing regarding SDG 2; No hunger and how the countries are working with this, how to acheive no hunger and produce more food in their country.</narrative>
  </description>
